    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup Trash Simulator Remastered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup Trash Simulator Remastered Is A Game About Picking Up Trash, With An Almost Fully Physics Based System, With Little To No Loading Time On PC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Get To Put Trash Into Two Dumpsters In The Middle Of The Park, You Just Pick It Up And Throw It Into The Dumpster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trash Has A Variety Of Cups Like Cup 1 And Cup 1, You Get To Pickup The Same Ol' Cup About 300 Times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's A Blast To Just Play And Enjoy The Game, Plus A Bonus When You Get Every Cup In The Dumpster You Just Restart The Level And Do It Over Again. Because Who Needs Endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's Plenty Of Stuff To Do Even If The Game Doesn't Have An Ending, I Added Some Extra Stuff To Keep You Entertained Even If There Isn't Much To The Base Game, Or If Your Feeling A Little Different You Can Go Through The Variety Of Extras Like Night Time, Snow Mode, Rain Mode And Sandbox Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Could Play Forever Literally! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even If You Don't Like Picking Up Trash In Real Life There's A Video Game For That,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have Fun.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup Trash Simulator Remastered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup Trash Simulator Remastered Is A Game About Picking Up Trash, With An Almost Fully Physics Based System, With Little To No Loading Time On PC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Get To Put Trash Into Two Dumpsters In The Middle Of The Park, You Just Pick It Up And Throw It Into The Dumpster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trash Has A Variety Of Cups Like Cup 1 And Cup 1, You Get To Pickup The Same Ol' Cup About 300 Times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's A Blast To Just Play And Enjoy The Game, Plus A Bonus When You Get Every Cup In The Dumpster You Just Restart The Level And Do It Over Again. Because Who Needs Endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's Plenty Of Stuff To Do Even If The Game Doesn't Have An Ending, I Added Some Extra Stuff To Keep You Entertained Even If There Isn't Much To The Base Game, Or If Your Feeling A Little Different You Can Go Through The Variety Of Extras Like Night Time, Snow Mode, Rain Mode And Sandbox Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Could Play Forever Literally! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even If You Don't Like Picking Up Trash In Real Life There's A Video Game For That,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have Fun.</p>",
